silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_15_witness_traceability_sections_02_witness_chain_protocol_concrete_anchor_1#cannon_cheese_md silm:hasLongDescription "The cannon/cheese.md is cannon/cheese.md is the source file for the cheese witness in the orientation entry. It is the leftmost node in the witness chain protocol diagram. The locate gate confirms it exists on disk; without this confirmation, the witness chain cannot start." .
